msgstr "Visual Studio 18 Build Tools 中的 Roslyn `csc.exe`"

#: manual/building.md:24
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/building.md:26
msgid "The decisions that need neither Unity nor the game live in `src/*.Pure.cs`, and each has a test in `tests/` that compiles with `csc` alone:"
msgstr "不需要 Unity 也不需要游戏的判断逻辑放在 `src/*.Pure.cs` 里，每个都在 `tests/` 里有一个只用 `csc` 就能编译的测试："

#: manual/building.md:32
msgid "Test"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/building.md:32
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "检查内容"

#: manual/building.md:34
msgid "The buying rule on small stores, nesting past the depth limit (no answer, so the game's own check runs), refusal, each item asked once, and 2,000 random stores against the rule as it reads"
msgstr "小型店铺上的收货规则、超过深度上限的嵌套（不给出答案，于是由游戏自己的判定执行）、拒收、每件物品只问一次，以及 2000 个随机店铺与规则原文的对照"

#: manual/building.md:35
msgid "While a save loads: each item's redraw waits once however often it is asked, runs once at the end with its containers, and is skipped if the item is gone"
msgstr "读档时：每件物品的重画无论被请求多少次都只等待一次，最后连同它的容器只执行一次，物品已不存在则跳过"

#: manual/building.md:36
msgid "When an inventory layout waits for the end of the frame and when it runs at once"
msgstr "库存布局何时等到帧末、何时立即执行"

#: manual/building.md:37
msgid "When the group-drag fit check must run again"
msgstr "成组拖动时何时需要重新判断能否放下"

#: manual/building.md:38
msgid "Which highlight squares are switched off after a refresh"
msgstr "刷新后关掉哪些高亮格"

#: manual/building.md:39
msgid "Which patches a fix that fails halfway removes again"
msgstr "中途失败的修复要撤掉哪些补丁"

#: manual/building.md:40
msgid "When the buyer check may be installed, given the game's language"
msgstr "根据游戏语言，何时可以安装收货判定"

#: manual/building.md:42
msgid "Each test prints `ok` or `FAIL` per case and exits with a non-zero code if any case fails."
msgstr "每个测试对每个用例输出 `ok` 或 `FAIL`，只要有一个用例失败就以非零代码退出。"

#: manual/building.md:44
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "语言"

#: manual/building.md:46
msgid "The options' text is in `Localization/`, one file per game language, named by the game's locale code: `en`, `zh`, `ja`, `ko`, `de`, `fr`, `es`, `it`, `pl`, `ru` and `ptBR`. A missing line falls back to English."
msgstr "选项文字在 `Localization/` 里，游戏的每种语言一个文件，以游戏的语言代码命名：`en`、`zh`、`ja`、`ko`、`de`、`fr`、`es`、`it`、`pl`、`ru` 和 `ptBR`。缺少的条目回退为英文。"

#: manual/building.md:48
msgid "Install by hand"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: manual/building.md:50
msgid "Copy the folder `out/performance_fixes` into the game's `Mods` folder, start the game, and enable the mod in the Mods menu. Mods load when the game starts, so restart after enabling or updating one."
msgstr "把 `out/performance_fixes` 文件夹复制到游戏的 `Mods` 文件夹，启动游戏，在模组菜单中启用它。模组在游戏启动时加载，所以启用或更新后要重启游戏。"

#: manual/building.md:52
msgid "The mod declares no capabilities, so the game enables it without a permission prompt."
msgstr "这个模组不声明任何权限，游戏启用它时不会弹出权限确认。"

#: manual/customers.md:1
#: manual/index.md:20
msgid "Customers"
msgstr "顾客"

#: manual/customers.md:3
#: manual/index.md:20
msgid "Fast buyer check"
msgstr "快速收货判定"

#: manual/customers.md:5
msgid "**Problem.** When the game decides whether the customer will buy an item (`StoreClient.IsClientBuyingThisItem`), it also checks a container's contents. It lists every item anywhere inside, runs the full check on each one, and each of those lists and checks its own contents again. For nested storage that is quadratic, and every level allocates a new list."
msgstr "**问题。** 游戏判断顾客是否会收某件物品时（`StoreClient.IsClientBuyingThisItem`），也会检查容器的内容。它列出里面所有层级的每件物品，对每一件做完整检查，而每一件又会列出并检查自己的内容。嵌套存储下这接近平方复杂度，而且每一层都要分配一个新列表。"

#: manual/customers.md:7
msgid "The game runs this check when an item is placed on the counter, when it decides whether something can be sold, and in the negotiation screen, once for every item in the back inventory."
msgstr "游戏会在这些时候运行这个检查：把物品放上柜台、判断能否出售，以及讨价还价界面，后者会对后仓中的每件物品各运行一次。"

#: manual/customers.md:9
msgid "**Fix.** The rule, read from the game's code:"
msgstr "**修复。** 从游戏代码中读出的规则如下："

#: manual/customers.md:11
msgid "an item is **bought** when it is acceptable on its own (the game's own check with `ignoreContents`) and, if its contents are checked, everything inside it is bought;"
msgstr "物品本身可接受（游戏自己带 `ignoreContents` 的检查），并且如果要检查内容，里面的东西全都会被收，这件物品才 **会被收**；"

#: manual/customers.md:12
msgid "contents are **checked** unless the item is currently locked, has no content window, or is an advanced gun."
msgstr "除非物品当前上锁、没有内容窗口或是高级枪械，否则都会 **检查内容**。"

#: manual/customers.md:14
msgid "`IsClientBuyingThisItem` and `IsClientRefusingItem`, in the forms that include contents, are patched to evaluate exactly that rule bottom-up, once per item per call. Answers are reused only within that call, never across calls or frames, so the result is always the game's own for the current state. The single-item form runs unchanged."
msgstr "模组修改了包含内容检查的 `IsClientBuyingThisItem` 和 `IsClientRefusingItem`，让它们自底向上严格按这条规则计算，每次调用中每件物品只算一次。结果只在本次调用内复用，从不跨调用或跨帧，所以结果始终与游戏对当前状态的判断一致。只检查单件物品的版本保持原样。"

#: manual/customers.md:16
msgid "Contents nested more than 32 levels deep get no answer from the rule. For such a call the game's own check runs instead, and its checks of the items inside come back through the fix one level down each time, so even then the answer is the game's."
msgstr "嵌套超过 32 层的内容物，规则不给出答案。这样的调用改由游戏自己的判定执行，它对内部物品的判定又会逐层回到本修复，所以即便如此，答案也是游戏自己的。"

#: manual/customers.md:18
msgid "**When it starts.** The game's own check uses a list of localized water names that the game fills in the first time it is needed. Installing the fix fills it in too, and mods start before the game applies the player's language. So the fix waits until the language the game chose at startup is applied, and only then installs. If that has not happened within five minutes, the fix stays off for the session and `Player.log` says so. Without this wait, water names would stay in English for the session and water would stop selling in any other language."
msgstr "**何时启动。** 游戏自己的判定会用到一份本地化的水名列表，游戏在第一次用到时才填写它。安装本修复也会让它被填写，而模组启动时游戏还没有应用玩家的语言。所以本修复会等到游戏启动时选定的语言生效后才安装。如果五分钟内仍未生效，本修复在这次游戏中保持关闭，`Player.log` 里会写明。没有这一步等待，水的名称会在整局里保持英文，在其他语言下水也会卖不出去。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:1
#: manual/index.md:21
#: manual/index.md:22
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:3
msgid "Long-frame log"
msgstr "长帧日志"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:5
msgid "With **Log long frames** on, frames longer than 100 ms are written to the game's `Player.log` as `[PerformanceFixes] long frame: ...`, with the container window opened just before, if any, and counters for each fix. It costs nothing."
msgstr "打开 **记录长帧** 后，超过 100 毫秒的帧会以 `[PerformanceFixes] long frame: ...` 写入游戏的 `Player.log`，附带刚刚打开的容器窗口（如果有）以及各项修复的计数。没有任何开销。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:7
msgid "`Player.log` is in `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Questing Goose Studio\\Probably Stolen`."
msgstr "`Player.log` 位于 `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Questing Goose Studio\\Probably Stolen`。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:9
msgid "Long-frame profiler"
msgstr "长帧分析器"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:11
msgid "**Profile long frames** goes further. While it is on, every per-frame callback of the game's MonoBehaviours, every layout pass (`Validate`) and everything the shop's main update calls, four levels deep, is timed, along with Unity's UI rebuild and rendering. Each frame over 100 ms is then logged with its slowest methods:"
msgstr "**分析长帧** 更进一步。开启期间，游戏所有 MonoBehaviour 的每帧回调、每次布局计算（`Validate`），以及店铺主更新往下四层调用的所有方法都会被计时，Unity 的 UI 重建和渲染也会单独计时。每个超过 100 毫秒的帧都会连同最慢的方法一起记录下来："

#: manual/diagnostics.md:17
msgid "Times are inclusive: a method that calls others includes them. The profiler adds a little overhead, so leave it off for normal play. It never lets a failure reach the game: if it cannot attach to a method, it skips it, and if it cannot start, it removes everything it attached."
msgstr "时间是包含式的：调用了其他方法的方法，其耗时包含被调用的部分。分析器有少量开销，正常游玩时请关闭。它绝不会让故障影响游戏：挂不上某个方法就跳过，无法启动就撤掉所有已挂上的计时。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:19
msgid "When a fix cannot attach"
msgstr "修复无法挂载时"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:21
msgid "After a game update, a fix may no longer find a method it patches. It then removes the patches it had already attached, so it is either fully on or fully off, and writes one line to `Player.log`: `[PerformanceFixes] <fix> is off: ...`. The other fixes keep working."
msgstr "游戏更新后，某项修复可能找不到它要打补丁的方法。这时它会撤掉自己已经挂上的补丁，所以要么完全生效，要么完全关闭，并在 `Player.log` 里写一行：`[PerformanceFixes] <fix> is off: ...`。其他修复照常工作。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:23
msgid "Regenerating the method lists"
msgstr "重新生成方法列表"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:25
msgid "The timed methods are listed in generated files, so the game's mod scanner sees every type named in code and asks for no permission:"
msgstr "被计时的方法列在自动生成的文件中，这样游戏的模组扫描器能在代码里看到每个被引用的类型，不会请求权限："

#: manual/diagnostics.md:27
msgid "`tools/GenProbe.cs` writes `src/Targets.g.cs`, the per-frame callbacks and layout passes."
msgstr "`tools/GenProbe.cs` 生成 `src/Targets.g.cs`，即每帧回调和布局计算。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:28
msgid "`tools/GenCallees.cs` writes `src/Callees.g.cs`, everything the given methods call, to a given depth."
msgstr "`tools/GenCallees.cs` 生成 `src/Callees.g.cs`，即指定方法在指定深度内调用的所有方法。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:30
msgid "Both leave out the game's mod loader, mod security and Steam integration, which mods may not patch. Regenerate them after a game update."
msgstr "两者都会排除游戏的模组加载器、模组安全和 Steam 集成部分，因为模组不允许修改它们。游戏更新后需要重新生成。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Performance Fixes"
msgstr "性能修复"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "Smoother shop, same game. This mod removes stutters from the base game when you work with large, packed storage. Every fix keeps the game's behaviour and only removes wasted work."
msgstr "店铺更流畅，玩法不变。这个模组消除游戏本体在处理大型满载仓库时的卡顿。每项修复都保持游戏原有行为，只去掉浪费的计算。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "![Performance Fixes cover](../attachments/cover.png)"
msgstr "![性能修复封面](../attachments/cover.png)"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "Every fix has its own switch in the mod's options: open the Mods menu, select Performance Fixes and click the gear icon. All of them are on by default except the profiler."
msgstr "每项修复在模组设置里都有独立开关：打开模组菜单，选中性能修复，点击齿轮图标。除分析器外，所有修复默认开启。"

